{"ticker":"HUBB","updated":"2026-10-23T23:06:06Z","profile":{"longName":"Hubbell Incorporated","shortName":"Hubbell Inc","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Electrical Equipment & Parts","country":"United States","website":"https://www.hubbell.com","fullTimeEmployees":19400,"marketCap":23674275840,"trailingPE":26.530493,"forwardPE":19.443071,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.803952,"pegRatio":1.86,"targetMeanPrice":555.53845,"targetHighPrice":630.0,"targetLowPrice":485.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":13,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.153,"earningsGrowth":-0.009,"grossMargins":0.35338002,"operatingMargins":0.21666999,"profitMargins":0.14491999,"totalRevenue":6223600128,"beta":0.846,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":565.4999,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":403.82,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.27},"summary":"Hubbell Incorporated, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells electrical and utility solutions in the United States and internationally. It operates through two segments, Electrical Solutions and Utility Solutions. The Utility Solution segment offers critical components that allow the grid to transmit and distribute energy, as well as the communications and controls technologies, including  utility transmission and distribution components, such as arresters, insulators, connectors, anchors, bushings, enclosures, cutouts, and switches; and solutions that serve the edge of the utility infrastructure comprising smart meters, communications systems, and protection and control devices. It sells its products under various brands and/or trademarks to the electrical distribution, substation and transmission markets, as well as markets for grid protection and controls, utility meters and advanced metering infrastructure and telcom and gas distribution markets. The Electrical Solution segment offers standard and special application wiring device products, rough-in electrical products, connector and grounding products, and other electrical equipment for use in industrial, commercial, and institutional facilities by electrical contractors, maintenance personnel, electricians, utilities, and telecommunications companies. It also designs and manufactures various industrial con","summary_zh":"Hubbell Incorporated 及其子公司在美國和國際上製造和銷售電氣和公用事業解決方案。它透過兩個部門運作：電氣解決方案部門和公用事業解決方案部門。公用事業解決方案部門提供允許電網傳輸和分配能源的關鍵組件，以及通訊和控制技術，包括公用事業傳輸和配電組件，例如避雷器、絕緣子、連接器、錨、套管、外殼、切口和開關；以及服務於公用事業基礎設施邊緣的解決方案，包括智慧電錶、通訊系統以及保護和控制設備。該公司以各種品牌和/或商標向配電、變電站和輸電市場以及電網保護和控制、公用事業儀表和先進計量基礎設施以及電信和燃氣分配市場銷售其產品。電氣解決方案部門提供標準和特殊應用接線設備產品、預裝電氣產品、連接器和接地產品以及電氣承包商、維修人員、電工、公用事業和電信公司在工業、商業和機構設施中使用的其他電氣設備。也設計和製造各種工業設備","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"電氣設備及零件","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":439.89,"h":442.125,"l":436.84,"c":437.56,"v":280425},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":436.87,"h":443.11,"l":436.87,"c":442.52,"v":546797},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":441.55,"h":447.47,"l":438.26,"c":446.06,"v":334424},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":447.11,"h":450.39,"l":444.36,"c":445.8,"v":481397},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":442.25,"h":443.63,"l":429.69,"c":430.99,"v":579238},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":429.065,"h":431.33,"l":422.14,"c":430.15,"v":422755},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":432.4,"h":432.4,"l":424.31,"c":428.8,"v":351022},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":430.0,"h":437.525,"l":426.885,"c":437.16,"v":434995},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":439.63,"h":443.0,"l":429.0,"c":436.04,"v":395847},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":436.01,"h":437.38,"l":430.055,"c":436.62,"v":453016},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":435.06,"h":437.67,"l":427.85,"c":437.24,"v":344619},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":441.48,"h":453.2,"l":439.67,"c":442.33,"v":538637},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":441.57,"h":452.24,"l":439.36,"c":450.93,"v":541351},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":449.55,"h":450.905,"l":436.8,"c":437.43,"v":729280},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":438.68,"h":442.18,"l":433.9375,"c":438.11,"v":658244},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":438.36,"h":438.78,"l":431.85,"c":435.44,"v":457196},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":435.28,"h":440.66,"l":429.57,"c":433.26,"v":440614},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":436.41,"h":443.48,"l":432.1963,"c":440.1,"v":